{
 "duration": 77.16,
 "frames": 2315,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "That shadow standing in the corner of your bedroom during sleep paralysis?",
   "t0": 0.321,
   "t1": 4.117,
   "f0": 10,
   "f1": 124
  },
  {
   "text": "It isn't a demon.",
   "t0": 4.684,
   "t1": 5.439,
   "f0": 141,
   "f1": 163
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a timing glitch inside your brain,",
   "t0": 5.817,
   "t1": 7.983,
   "f0": 175,
   "f1": 239
  },
  {
   "text": "and it happens to you every single night.",
   "t0": 8.349,
   "t1": 10.099,
   "f0": 250,
   "f1": 303
  },
  {
   "text": "Normally,",
   "t0": 10.855,
   "t1": 11.553,
   "f0": 326,
   "f1": 347
  },
  {
   "text": "when you enter REM sleep,",
   "t0": 11.553,
   "t1": 12.947,
   "f0": 347,
   "f1": 388
  },
  {
   "text": "the stage where you dream,",
   "t0": 13.11,
   "t1": 14.57,
   "f0": 393,
   "f1": 437
  },
  {
   "text": "your brainstem flips a biological safety switch called REM atonia.",
   "t0": 14.733,
   "t1": 18.63,
   "f0": 442,
   "f1": 559
  },
  {
   "text": "It floods your spinal cord with two chemicals,",
   "t0": 19.246,
   "t1": 21.896,
   "f0": 577,
   "f1": 657
  },
  {
   "text": "GABA and glycine,",
   "t0": 21.896,
   "t1": 23.1,
   "f0": 657,
   "f1": 693
  },
  {
   "text": "shutting down your voluntary muscles.",
   "t0": 23.408,
   "t1": 25.113,
   "f0": 702,
   "f1": 753
  },
  {
   "text": "Why?",
   "t0": 25.754,
   "t1": 26.038,
   "f0": 773,
   "f1": 781
  },
  {
   "text": "So you don't physically act out your dreams and hurt yourself.",
   "t0": 26.549,
   "t1": 29.471,
   "f0": 796,
   "f1": 884
  },
  {
   "text": "But sometimes,",
   "t0": 30.174,
   "t1": 31.463,
   "f0": 905,
   "f1": 944
  },
  {
   "text": "your conscious mind wakes up before your brainstem turns that lock off.",
   "t0": 31.463,
   "t1": 35.586,
   "f0": 944,
   "f1": 1068
  },
  {
   "text": "Therefore,",
   "t0": 36.225,
   "t1": 36.77,
   "f0": 1087,
   "f1": 1103
  },
  {
   "text": "you are fully awake,",
   "t0": 36.77,
   "t1": 37.86,
   "f0": 1103,
   "f1": 1136
  },
  {
   "text": "trapped inside a paralyzed body.",
   "t0": 38.104,
   "t1": 40.281,
   "f0": 1143,
   "f1": 1208
  },
  {
   "text": "And here's the terrifying part:",
   "t0": 41.149,
   "t1": 42.524,
   "f0": 1234,
   "f1": 1276
  },
  {
   "text": "your brain's fear center,",
   "t0": 43.002,
   "t1": 44.111,
   "f0": 1290,
   "f1": 1323
  },
  {
   "text": "the amygdala,",
   "t0": 44.312,
   "t1": 45.125,
   "f0": 1329,
   "f1": 1354
  },
  {
   "text": "immediately panics because you can't move.",
   "t0": 45.292,
   "t1": 47.248,
   "f0": 1359,
   "f1": 1417
  },
  {
   "text": "At the same time,",
   "t0": 48.111,
   "t1": 49.254,
   "f0": 1443,
   "f1": 1478
  },
  {
   "text": "your brain is still half-stuck in dream mode.",
   "t0": 49.254,
   "t1": 51.827,
   "f0": 1478,
   "f1": 1555
  },
  {
   "text": "So it tries to explain the terror by projecting a vivid dream directly onto your real bedroom,",
   "t0": 52.297,
   "t1": 57.941,
   "f0": 1569,
   "f1": 1738
  },
  {
   "text": "creating the shadow figure and the crushing weight on your chest.",
   "t0": 57.941,
   "t1": 61.197,
   "f0": 1738,
   "f1": 1836
  },
  {
   "text": "Within seconds,",
   "t0": 62.078,
   "t1": 63.03,
   "f0": 1862,
   "f1": 1891
  },
  {
   "text": "the brainstem catches up,",
   "t0": 63.03,
   "t1": 64.459,
   "f0": 1891,
   "f1": 1934
  },
  {
   "text": "the chemicals clear,",
   "t0": 64.634,
   "t1": 65.52,
   "f0": 1939,
   "f1": 1966
  },
  {
   "text": "and the monster vanishes.",
   "t0": 65.831,
   "t1": 66.861,
   "f0": 1975,
   "f1": 2006
  },
  {
   "text": "Your brain didn't just trap you.",
   "t0": 67.6,
   "t1": 68.96,
   "f0": 2028,
   "f1": 2069
  },
  {
   "text": "It literally hallucinated a threat to explain its own mistake.",
   "t0": 69.384,
   "t1": 72.924,
   "f0": 2082,
   "f1": 2188
  },
  {
   "text": "And it's not the only time your brain edits reality right in front of your eyes.",
   "t0": 73.568,
   "t1": 76.833,
   "f0": 2207,
   "f1": 2305
  }
 ],
